# Prettier Ignore Patterns
# Prettier also skips files matched by .gitignore and ignores node_modules by default.
#
# Reference: https://prettier.io/docs/ignore
#
# To ignore specific lines, add a comment directly above them:
# JavaScript and TypeScript = // prettier-ignore
# Markdown and HTML         = <!-- prettier-ignore -->
# CSS                       = /* prettier-ignore */
# YAML                      = # prettier-ignore

# Archived implementation kept for reference
/previous-code

# Build output
**/dist

# Lock files
**/package-lock.json

# Minified files
**/*.min.js
